A note on what this licence does and does not cover.

The MIT terms above apply to this repository: the engine, the tooling, the
tests, the 110 missions and the vocalisation word list alike. Copy it, change
it, translate it, put it on your own site — keep the copyright line and you are
within your rights.

Two things are not the author's to licence, and the MIT grant does not reach
them. The closing quotations are the words of the people credited beside them,
reproduced for commentary and parody; where a quotation is attributed,
reconstructed or disputed, the attribution line says so. Company and product
names belong to their owners and appear here for parody and commentary only —
this game is not affiliated with, endorsed by or sponsored by any of them.

The game is satire. The floors are built on documented events, which is exactly
why the missions, the characters and the plot are invented, and any resemblance
to real conduct by any person or company is coincidental.
